==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
The Zir Zeal is the largest threat here and will do his usual job of burrowing under your [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] to take out the base if you're not careful. Save a tanky Zombie Killer for when Zir Zeal spawns so you're not caught unawares. [[:Category:Omni Strike Cats|Omni Strike]] Zombie Killers are great for dealing with the undead water mammal. Constant meatshielding is needed to keep the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] at bay, and you get no [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] peons to farm off of until Helmut Krabbe spawns.

The Helmut Krabbe stream at the end of the stage is the least of your worries as long as you have enough [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] and units with high DPS out. The massive amount of Those Guys make for great Long Distance sniping as you'll always have a target without the Krabbes pushing up and reaching the attackers.

Overall, it's not too much different than the regular stage, just be prepared with backup Zombie Killers for Zir Zeal.

